<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html>
<head>
<title>misnested phrasing</title>
</head>
<body>
<p><a href="one"><strong><em>first</a> second</em></strong> third
<p><font color="#12" face="x" size="999"><big><small><tt>text</font></small></big></tt>
<marquee behavior=scroll direction=sideways loop=-1>moving <blink>content</marquee>
<pre>line one
line two <code>&lt;tag&gt;</code>
line three</pre>
<ruby>漢<rt>kan<rp>(</rp><rtc>annotation</rtc><rp>)</rp></ruby>
<map name=x><area shape=poly coords="1,2,3" href="#"><area nohref></map>
<img src=x alt="a&amp;b" usemap="#x" ismap width=nan height=-4>
<p><del>old <ins>new <s>strike</del> insert</s></ins>
<dl compact>
<dt>term one
<dd>definition <p>paragraph inside
<dt><span>term two
<dd><ol start="not-a-number"><li value="x">item<li>next</ol>
</dl>
<center><hr width="100%%" noshade><wbr><nobr>nowrap</nobr></center>
</body>
</html>